# Every variant too: .env.bak, .env.local, .env.production. Only the
# bare name was ignored, and a real .env.bak-tts holding live
# ElevenLabs/Deepgram keys sat here untracked and one `git add -A`
# away from being committed. .env.example stays tracked on purpose.
.env.*
